{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1173101e-4fd2-5868-8661-5698d1dcf38b", "source_ordinal": 3328, "reading_ordinal": 724, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "持重", "published_at": "2021-05-13T02:02:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/57233338/answer/1883076221"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个涉及的是绝对权力的自我克制问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一般的人面对的是选择不足，想要的选择自己没有能力获得，但是一个国家政府真正困难的问题在于克制。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "政府手上有着极强的政策工具，说句实话，只要想拿到一笔财富，可用的办法实在是太多。", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不要误会，其合法性不会有任何问题，其后果也完全可以在有生之年足够不明显。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但政府需要克制。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为任何一种与付出的努力不挂钩的、不具有自收敛性的来钱做法，都会有极度难以摆脱和控制的危险性，一个负责任的政府不可以允许自己相信自己肯定可以操控它。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "除非万不得已，否则能免则免。即使是万不得已，也是一旦脱困就要放下。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "放不下，就是天塌地陷、推倒重来才能止住的大祸。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "很多最后让王朝覆灭的东西，在最初都有无可辩驳的“显著合理性”，算盘一打简直一本万利。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "印交钞、卖青苗、一条鞭、捐监生……多少自觉没毛病甚至还赚了两年钱的政策，撼动国本。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "计算看不出什么问题，基本上还是会被当作有问题，只是问题超出了人当前的认知能力而已。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这可以算是中国的一种政治文化上的信仰。", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 433}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0120"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：房产税为何迟迟不可开征？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "作者围绕“持重”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“这个涉及的是绝对权力的自我克制问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个涉及的是绝对权力的自我克制问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1827d272-1f93-53f1-8750-e53ce5585623", "source_ordinal": 3327, "reading_ordinal": 725, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "防早恋", "published_at": "2021-05-13T03:55:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/20767915/answer/1883107152"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "主要靠教育子女提高对人的审美品味，习得正确的厌恶感——也就是不防早恋，只防劣恋。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这点极其极其重要，可以说是父母必须要争分夺秒在青春期之前完成的东西。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "远远的胜过催成绩、盯考试。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所谓“正确的厌恶”，就是对不可持续的价值观的敏感，对伦理问题的敏感。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "比如感情用事、比如睚眦必报、比如擅自泄露ta人的隐私、比如干预ta人的自由、比如擅自判断人、比如热衷八卦、比如逃避责任等等等等。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你要尽可能抓住引起子女的一切喜怒哀乐的新鲜事件，将其视为讲解的机会，趁着案例的新鲜和感受的清晰，条分缕析的从定义到机制引导ta们想清楚“什么是应该，什么是不应该”。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不是简单的宣布“这样就是对的”“不这样就是错的”，而是仔仔细细讲清楚什么算是“这样”，什么看起来很像但其实不是，而“这样”又为什么逻辑上最后行不通，如何观察和分析身边类似这样的情况和持续观察验证自己的看法。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这种“亲身案例分析会”，要时时开、周周开、月月开，把培养这种概念的涵摄能力视为最核心的任务来做。", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是防止和根绝子女陷入低质量关系的釜底抽薪之计。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 450}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一个培养得当的少年，对于大量会被自己同龄人认为酷炫、可爱、值得崇拜和惊叹的东西有很强的免疫力。从而对各种各样其实背后隐藏着极大的不祥之兆的行为，不但不会如对方所期望的那样心生爱慕，反而会生出厌恶和回避。", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那些人越追、越卖弄，你的子女反而越会厌恶和冷淡，根本不可能会“被感动”“怜悯”或者“惊艳”。", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要想赢得ta们的倾慕，不仅仅要品性善良且勇敢，还必须有以ta们的洞察力也不能不钦佩的智慧。这不是指分数，而是指明察善恶。", "char_start": 600, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果ta们对世间百态的分析观察之细致、推论之严谨、系统之完整、信念之纯洁已经屡屡令你不由得暗暗称奇、感到敬佩，那么ta们的选择你又有什么立场去反对呢？", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "ta们自己已经知道善恶与是非，你不必担心ta们会喜欢上错误的人。", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "别的不说，基本上ta的同龄人不容易有人能入ta们的法眼——现在在青少年中流行的很多价值观是过不了ta们的心理关的。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "会讨大部分同龄异性喜欢的行为——譬如“篮球打得帅”“五官清秀/精致”“身材好”“成绩优秀”之类，在你子女眼里根本不值钱。想看得懂ta们的按钮在哪里，本身就有很高的人格健全的门槛。想要按得到这些按钮，必须有真实的善良和勇敢。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 939}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "到了这样，你就不需要担心了。不只是不需要担心ta早恋，是不需要担心ta的整个人生。", "char_start": 940, "char_end": 981}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "并且，这些伦理问题的讨论训练，本身就是很好的学术能力的磨练。能在伦理价值观问题上有可观的造诣，在认识能力、系统化能力上远远超过一般高中、大学的学术要求。不只是语文、英语这些对表达精确性敏感的科目必定会出类拔萃，事实上数学、物理、化学这些高度依赖基本概念的深刻掌握的学科也必定举重若轻。", "char_start": 982, "char_end": 1124}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这其实是一石二鸟的。", "char_start": 1125, "char_end": 1135}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如何看待14岁女孩与男友开房被父亲发现后被打骨折？\n家族答集\n第一性\n社科答集\n文艺答集", "char_start": 1136, "char_end": 1180}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这本来就是为帮助你们做到这条写的，每一个都是。", "char_start": 1180, "char_end": 1203}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 1136, "sample": "如何看待14岁女孩与男友开房被父亲发现后被打骨折？\n家族答集\n第一性\n社科答集\n文艺答集"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0120"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何教育孩子不要早恋？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "作者围绕“防早恋”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“主要靠教育子女提高对人的审美品味，习得正确的厌恶感——也就是不防早恋，只防劣恋。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "主要靠教育子女提高对人的审美品味，习得正确的厌恶感——也就是不防早恋，只防劣恋。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "92d474ef-fec4-5737-aba2-42f8ed14e0ee", "source_ordinal": 3326, "reading_ordinal": 726, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "感性", "published_at": "2021-05-13T14:03:56+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/23169298/answer/1883853598"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“感性”其实是个伪概念。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "当一个人评价另一个人“很感性”的时候，ta事实上是在评价对方“不理性”，只不过做了“礼貌上的中和”罢了。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这种评价表明了两层态度——", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "首先，ta相信自己可以分辨何谓理性的，何谓不理性的。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "其次，ta基本认为理性是高贵的、非理性的决策逻辑是落后的、低贱的，因而是值得怜悯的。为了不刺激这可怜的人，所以假装“感性很重要”“感性也很好”，最后把“你这是感性”作为一种真诚的施舍送给对方——有时是自己。", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "送给自己的时候，更多是因为这时理性的权威在别人手里，自己也不能不承认这一点，于是在恐慌性之下为了对抗理性霸权的绝对统治，自己必须要拿出一种看上去与理性势均力敌的“敌体”来作为基本后盾。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这基本上就是“感性”概念被“哲学家”们制造出来，而又被渴望这盾牌的人们热烈欢迎的诞生过程。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "事实上，“感性”的定义不过是一缕青烟，仔细看看背后说来说去不过是不敢坦白承认的“非理性”三个字而已。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "问题是，对抗“理性的霸权”，你并不需要高举“感性”这样的劣等品来自我防卫。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为在对方的道理和你的决策之间本来就隔着一层对方无法涉足的领域，就是你的决策数据和你的价值观自由。对方在对方所假设的前提上是正确的，并不意味着你必须依从对方给出的具体指示，因为没人能如同你一样了解你的条件、意图和价值观。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你根本用不着整个的否定理性的有效性，靠主张“理性推断并不是都能说中”这种事实上没有意义论述来对抗理性霸权。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为理性本来就只能指出最好的赌注。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "（顺便，那些认为自己理性的结果等于真理的人，根本不知道理性是什么东西。）", "char_start": 622, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你并不应该因为看得到这仍然不是100%把握，就放弃理性的结果，这就好像你不应该因为觉得“走下山也不能保证不摔跤”，于是决定滚下山一样。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 726}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "看明白了这个问题，我们再来谈“感性”问题。不过，从这里开始，我们不再使用这种“被赏赐的怜悯”，直接使用“非显式理性决策“这个更精确的称呼。", "char_start": 727, "char_end": 796}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "常被称为“感性”的东西，实际上是内嵌在人类本能之中的一种“非显式理性决策系统”。", "char_start": 797, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "举个例子来说，你明知某种蜘蛛是无毒的，但你一伸手就会寒毛直竖；你明知尿液是无菌的，但你想起来就皱眉；你明知某种蠕虫是无害甚至营养丰富的蛋白质，但你想象一下口感就感到恶心。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 923}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你明知某事在账面计算上有盈利，但你无法接受——到了这一步，是不是“感性”的的评价就出来了？", "char_start": 924, "char_end": 969}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "举凡种种被称为“感性”的决策方法，都是先于人的理性由长期自然演化和长期群里实践积淀下来的文化影响的结果。它或者通过基因、或者通过语言学习、文化浸润而绕过了人类的显式理性机制，在底层深刻的影响着人的行为。", "char_start": 970, "char_end": 1071}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "受影响者往往根本不理解这样做的理由是什么，只是被不这样做的想象所触发的直接生理反应所限制而被动的遭遇了那样高决策门槛。", "char_start": 1072, "char_end": 1131}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如没有绝对充分的理由和绝对明确的危机，人们仅仅凭着“纸上计算可行”，并不能翻越这些门槛。", "char_start": 1132, "char_end": 1176}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这使得打算靠这些“完美纸上作业”来决定性的影响ta人行为的人倍感挫折。——ta们其实是想骂对方“不理性”的，只不过年头久了学精了，改用“你很感性”这种政治正确话术罢了。", "char_start": 1177, "char_end": 1261}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "但是这些从广泛的幸存事实里被遗传和直接写入的既定决策逻辑，真的因为当事人自己自觉的欠缺而是“非理性”的吗？", "char_start": 1262, "char_end": 1315}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你们觉得老鹰、章鱼的身体设计合理吗？", "char_start": 1316, "char_end": 1334}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你们要记住那不是任何人类的理性过程的结果。", "char_start": 1335, "char_end": 1356}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "不走人类显式理性路线的结果，在确切意义上当然一定是“非理性”的，但是并不意味着它一定不是合理的。", "char_start": 1357, "char_end": 1405}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "凭着本能的强烈不安、拿不出任何说得通的理由，却不能听从你的说服的人，其决策未必真的没有合理性。不梳理和分析具体的原因，仅仅凭着扣上“感性”或者“非理性”的帽子，强行压制对方顺从，结果往往不是你可以得意洋洋的说“我早说过吧”，而是一场大败。", "char_start": 1406, "char_end": 1525}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你想真正说服人，并不是只要赢得与人显式理性的论辩而已，你还要对那个ta自己也说不清的道理做出交代。", "char_start": 1526, "char_end": 1575}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "所以不用奇怪为什么你头头是道，而对方却不“服气”。", "char_start": 1576, "char_end": 1601}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你所讨厌人的“感性”，本质上是一种人自己没有掌握的超理性。", "char_start": 1602, "char_end": 1631}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "最后我们来回答这个问题——“如何权衡理性与感性”？", "char_start": 1633, "char_end": 1658}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "答案是理性和“感性”并不是一个“权衡”、“取舍”的关系。", "char_start": 1659, "char_end": 1687}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "人的理性必须要学会尊重和敬畏自己的非理性本能。", "char_start": 1688, "char_end": 1711}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你的感性“坚决的反对”，绝不是因为它真的反对和抗拒你的理性本身，而是在强烈的提示理性的论述尚有遗漏，其自洽仍然是傲慢的。", "char_start": 1712, "char_end": 1772}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "是的，这不是在否定你是自洽的，但这是在提示你的自洽是视野局限的结果。", "char_start": 1773, "char_end": 1807}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你的直觉本能在反复的、焦虑的希望你看到一个ta说不出来的点，好像一头忠犬扯着你的裤腿不让你上车一样。", "char_start": 1808, "char_end": 1858}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "ta说不出来，但是ta有一个point。", "char_start": 1859, "char_end": 1879}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "ta不是要反对你、不是要妨碍你、而是想要帮助你，想要你看到某个ta知道，但是无法借着你现在粗糙的理智来告诉给你的要害。", "char_start": 1880, "char_end": 1939}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "如果你是时间紧迫，你只需要向ta恳切的说明——", "char_start": 1940, "char_end": 1963}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "“我知道你虽然说不出来，但我相信你必有point，但很抱歉已经没有时间继续谈论了，不得不如此。我无法选择听从你的提醒而放弃现在的打算，但我会尽可能小幅、尽可能可逆的稳健推进，并且我答应你永远不放松对你所担忧的问题的警惕和对周期性回顾的坚持。”", "char_start": 1964, "char_end": 2085}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "ta要的只是这句话。", "char_start": 2086, "char_end": 2096}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你说了这句话，ta就会坐下，不再需要你“权衡”是丢掉它，还是丢掉你的理性。", "char_start": 2097, "char_end": 2134}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "不过，你最好不要欺骗ta。", "char_start": 2135, "char_end": 2148}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 44}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0120"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何权衡感性和理性？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043"], "summary": "作者围绕“感性”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：““感性”其实是个伪概念。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“感性”其实是个伪概念。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "16a059df-ba77-5ca8-8f92-f5d1b0e90825", "source_ordinal": 3325, "reading_ordinal": 727, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "看论证", "published_at": "2021-05-14T08:54:15+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/413077543/answer/1885119748"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这种话一般不表示什么客观的学术评价，只表示了人对“贡献”的定义的个人主张。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你把贡献的门槛提高，总可以提高到只剩第一名是正值，其它所有人都是零的状态。你甚至还可以提高到所有人都是负值，只剩中国是零的状态。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你还可以通过改变边界，恰好把没贡献的一部分算作中国，然后说中国没贡献的状态。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "对于善于构造概念的人而言，任何结论都可以是对的。所以，看人的话不要去看结论，要看定义和论证。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "小孩子们最容易犯的错误，就是过度关心结论，而不关心定义和论证。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "看定义和论证也不是光看定义、论证和结论本身是不是协调一致——如果这个不一致，那是缺少基本的逻辑能力，但即使这里一致，也未必这就是一个合理的论述。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "更关键的，是看这一论述是否与所有其它ta本人主张、坚持或者追求的论述协调一致，有没有自相矛盾。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "举个例子——", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一个人说，“所有给人造成麻烦的人都是王八蛋”。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "接下去你问ta如何定义“麻烦”，如何定义“王八蛋”，如何定义“制造”，不管ta怎么定义，只要不使这句话出现自我矛盾——比如把王八蛋定义为“不给人造成麻烦的人”——ta的论述都可以成立。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 465}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "定义权是论述者当然的特权，你要论证ta的论述是否合乎逻辑，不能按照你自己的定义，而必须按照论述者的定义，否则你只是在论述你自己所理解的版本不成立，那跟对方的主张自身成不成立无关。", "char_start": 466, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而对方只要没有自相矛盾，就有权主张任何论述。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "问题在于，自相矛盾的考察并没有到“这句话内部没有自相矛盾”为止，而是你的任何主张都应该与你的一切其它主张协调一致。", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 636}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "也就是接下去你要问ta，“你有没有给别人造成麻烦”？", "char_start": 637, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "“麻烦是按照你的定义，还是按照被麻烦的人的定义？”", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 689}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果是按照制造麻烦的人的定义，那么任何人只要不把自己给别人造成的影响定义为麻烦，则任何人都不会是王八蛋，只剩下想当王八蛋的人是王八蛋了。", "char_start": 690, "char_end": 758}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果这定义权在被影响的人手里——", "char_start": 759, "char_end": 775}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "“那么你的这个主张就给我造成了麻烦，因为按照你这个论述我就是王八蛋。所以按照这个论述你也是王八蛋。”", "char_start": 776, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "注意，关键来了——", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这时ta要是面红耳赤，要跟你讨论茴字的四种写法、偷书不算偷，你就要记住教训，不必对这人的其它论述设定太大的阅读优先级了——因为这人还缺少必要的谈论问题的能力，其结论的含金量是不够的。", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 928}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "而对方如果拈花微笑——“不错，朕就是这样的汉子。”", "char_start": 929, "char_end": 954}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那你反而要拱手抱拳，率领斧头帮全体同仁向火云邪神致敬。", "char_start": 955, "char_end": 982}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这叫做own his/her words。", "char_start": 983, "char_end": 1004}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这反而可以继续看下去——甚至会是一个有趣的开端。", "char_start": 1005, "char_end": 1029}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0120"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老师说中国对人类现代文明的贡献为零，我该如何反驳他？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "作者围绕“看论证”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“这种话一般不表示什么客观的学术评价，只表示了人对“贡献”的定义的个人主张。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这种话一般不表示什么客观的学术评价，只表示了人对“贡献”的定义的个人主张。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b9cd3705-2962-520e-8636-c3bbcf8580fb", "source_ordinal": 3324, "reading_ordinal": 728, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "脱困", "published_at": "2021-05-14T10:57:15+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/459325343/answer/1885361656"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "首先有一点要搞清楚——所有没有被人身禁锢的人，都在过自己想过的生活，哪怕ta在说“我不想过这样的生活”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个就像一个有手有脚、可以走动的人坐在一块石头上，却宣布自己“不想坐在这块石头上”一样，是不成立的。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果不想，就不会只是口头一说，却没有站起来迈开腿。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "坐在石头上说“我不想坐在这块石头上”，意思并不是ta不想坐在石头上，而是“ta想既坐在石头上，而且同时说这句话”。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "任何人身自由而身处“困境”之中，又没有有效的行动去改变这个困境，只是在不断述说自己多么“不想待在这个困境里”，多么“嫌弃”这困境的人，都和这位坐在石头上的人没有本质的区别。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "答案很简单，这个“困境”，只是“可以说处在困境中的人才能说的一些话，享受处在困境中的人才能享受的一些待遇”的“必要代价”。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "有很多周期性向朋友哭诉可怜的女性——注意，不包含没有行动能力的那些——在已经明确被告知了如何做就可以脱离这个境地的情况下，不选择终止这个可怜的状态，而选择继续可怜着、继续哭诉，她们就是在选择“为了保留诉说困境的资格，附带保留困境本身”。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 455}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是一个事实。", "char_start": 456, "char_end": 463}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为人类的天然属性，身处困境中的人在文化上有一种非常特殊的属性，就是会免疫于一切责任、免疫于一切要求、免疫于一切责怪，优先获得关注、无代价获得照顾、无条件获得宽容和原谅。", "char_start": 464, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "在很多情况下，小孩子们都会在漫长的成长过程中通过各种各样的机缘巧合发现：只要自己处在困境里——比如生病、受伤、被鉴定为心理障碍、考试严重失常……原本严厉的父母、老师不但会放下原来的令人痛苦的“为你好”的苛责，而且会给予一段无责任、无条件的宽待，更不用说对于亲戚、朋友、外人更是如此了。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 692}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这是一种很大的特权。", "char_start": 693, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而无要求、无责怪、无代价的照顾，无条件的宽容和原谅，这听起来耳熟吗？", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 738}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这听起来是“爱”。", "char_start": 739, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "爱是无价之宝，与之相比，那些早已适应了的“困境”“自我嫌弃”……当然是微不足道的。", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 790}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "只要忍受那些就可以换得到“爱”，显然这是一个非常理想的策略。", "char_start": 791, "char_end": 821}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "为什么这个“爱”要打引号？", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 835}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为这个“爱”和真正的爱有一个至关重要的区别——", "char_start": 836, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "那就是这些在实效上确实无条件、无代价的付出和宽容，是别人受限于“受苦人”的身份和自己生而为人的本能而不得不给予的，是对方不自由的结果。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 928}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而真正的爱，是因为愿意给而给的，是对方自由的最好的实现和使用，而不是因为出于任何的限制不得不如此，是ta人完全自由的结果，每一点每一滴都必须是。", "char_start": 929, "char_end": 1001}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而微妙的是这两者之间存在交叠。", "char_start": 1002, "char_end": 1017}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "也就是在开始人总是愿意的，是在后来发现坐在石头上的人其实是自己愿意坐在石头上，而导致整个事情的性质扭曲了。", "char_start": 1018, "char_end": 1071}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "从发现这一点之后，绝大多数人都会转向不愿意。", "char_start": 1072, "char_end": 1094}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这在坐在石头上的人看来，可以很简单的归因于“人的爱始终是有限的”这种万用逻辑。", "char_start": 1095, "char_end": 1134}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "人的爱当然是有限的，只不过这里的关系转向的主因并不是因为人的爱是有限的，而是因为在觉察到这一点之后继续在被迫的心态下给予这些东西根本就不是爱，而只是无力解除这种受迫状态而已。", "char_start": 1135, "char_end": 1222}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为爱虽然出于人的本能，但却不可以是出于人对本能的无能。", "char_start": 1223, "char_end": 1251}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "对这些觉察到了的人而言，这只不过是一种受骗上当，而且一次次的呕心沥血提供帮助，要帮助人离开那块石头，却似乎是泥牛入海，没有结果。", "char_start": 1252, "char_end": 1316}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "每一次似乎都可以被解释为“不了解对方的难处”“低估了对方困境的复杂性”。但谁能知道这和“对方自己其实不想改变”的区别？", "char_start": 1317, "char_end": 1376}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "试得越多，沉没成本越大，这种困惑就必然的越向后者移动。总有一天，对方会不能不认定这其实就是骗局——因为自称“处在困境中”的人的行动实在无法在最低的限度上解释其人的意愿的真实性。", "char_start": 1377, "char_end": 1465}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "认定为骗局，为什么还要继续受骗？这不是爱，而是无能罢了。", "char_start": 1466, "char_end": 1494}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "而这件事的危险之处在于——它本身是可以借着这世界上无限存在的不知情的人的默认的同情本能而无限延续的。", "char_start": 1495, "char_end": 1545}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "只要坐在石头上的人仍然衣食无忧，没有受到什么无法绕过的硬物理限制而无法持续，而且也满足于这种爱的等效物——尤其是其前半段还确实是真的爱——的无限供给，这件事是没有出口的。", "char_start": 1546, "char_end": 1631}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "其代价不过是自己做一个绝不能有能力承担任何责任的人，因为一旦有任何能力，就无法再享受这个特权了。不但不能享受这个特权，原则上还必须要回报之前的付出者，这岂不是一个巨大的亏损吗？", "char_start": 1632, "char_end": 1720}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而“保持绝不能有能力承担任何责任”，就是选择做一个绝对意义上的废人，那么，作为一个绝对意义上的废人，一旦真正出现供给的断档，后面那个硬物理限制迟早要到来。因为长期的维持无能状态，会让任何平平常常的生活日常挑战越来越变成不可逾越的困难。", "char_start": 1721, "char_end": 1838}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "迟早有一天，赚到一天的吃饭钱都会成为弱不经风者不可能完成的巨大困难。到了这一步，“饭都吃不上”的硬限制岂能不近在眼前？", "char_start": 1839, "char_end": 1898}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "追根到底，世界被做了“最终不允许人做这种选择”的设计。", "char_start": 1899, "char_end": 1926}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "这个世界的规则设计是滴水不漏的，爱是预定了会给你的，但是滥用绝不会被永久的容忍。", "char_start": 1927, "char_end": 1967}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "对弱者的同情和爱是绝对的义务，否则人不会那么容易发现这个“漏洞”，但是如果人打算有意或者假装无意的利用这个“漏洞”来榨取爱，后面自有自动发生的、没有任何人能替你免掉的后果。", "char_start": 1968, "char_end": 2054}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "那些同情者最后的离开也罢、愤恨也罢，其实都不过是人生的一段小插曲。ta们原不原谅，其实无关大局——一个没了，自然还有下一个；个个都没了，至少在几十年的漫长岁月里总还有无处可躲的父母和亲戚。", "char_start": 2055, "char_end": 2149}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "但总有一天，无可回避的物理硬限制会到来，它不会对长期这样做的人有丝毫的同情和宽免，不会听取人一切“值得同情的”“微妙的”“高雅的”理由。而只要它到来，它就是公正的。", "char_start": 2150, "char_end": 2232}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "除了它之外，时间越久，那份无法自欺的自欺欺人也会在你面前越来越稀薄。", "char_start": 2233, "char_end": 2267}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "你在做什么，只有你自己的行动才能对你自己证明。", "char_start": 2268, "char_end": 2291}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "你到底是真的无力从石头上走开，还是在沉迷于坐在石头上的福利故意不从石头上走开，你在任何时候都可以用自己的行动证明是前者。", "char_start": 2292, "char_end": 2352}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "每一次“努力失败”你都可以说我是真的没有这个能力，没有任何人类可以说“我比你了解你自己，你不是这个情况”——确实没有人比你了解你自己，说这话永远可以说是“站着说话不腰疼”。", "char_start": 2353, "char_end": 2439}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "这也是这样做的人可以长期不费力的维持这种努力但无实效的状态内在机制。因为让帮助的人看到满头大汗是有效延长福利期的自然手段，而代价只不过是承认另一层无人可以责怪的无能。", "char_start": 2440, "char_end": 2523}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "非不愿也，实无能也，无能怎么责怪？", "char_start": 2524, "char_end": 2541}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "但是，真相是不是如此，时间久了，你自己自然知道。", "char_start": 2542, "char_end": 2566}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "最后回答整个问题——", "char_start": 2567, "char_end": 2577}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "这是爱的机制的一种天然的“漏洞”，它同时造成了以下事实：", "char_start": 2578, "char_end": 2606}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "1）它通过人类自身的演化，内嵌了人类同情的本能，从而确保了困苦弱小者有机会得到无条件的帮助。（这获得帮助的资格甚至不限于人类同类，可以延及动物。）", "char_start": 2607, "char_end": 2680}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "2）它确保了一切心理健康的人类都必须承担基本的扶弱济困的义务。", "char_start": 2681, "char_end": 2712}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "3）它确保了一切心理健康的人类都有对错误利用这一漏洞者的识别能力和本能回避。它通过无限造成利益、情感、人格上的必然损失而惩罚那些贪图爱的荣耀而拒绝服从回避本能的人，甚至最终对坚持拒绝服从这一禁令的人予以处决——这事实上把“禁止对利用漏洞者滥用爱的资源，以保留不恶意利用者可获得的份额”上升到了自然法义务的高度。", "char_start": 2713, "char_end": 2868}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "4）它给了利用漏洞者足够的时间自行悔改，当最后的“无可回避的硬物理限制”到来，即使是利用者自己也会知道这无任何ta人可以责怪。值得玩味的是，如果这时候ta还在责怪人类对ta不够同情，ta在此时的困境只会更孤立而更险恶。", "char_start": 2869, "char_end": 2978}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "5）它在整个路径上不断的给了人悔改的机会——只要你站起来走一步，你就离开石头了——哪怕只是一毫米。几年几十年了，你还在石头上坐着，你无法解释为世界不给你机会。", "char_start": 2979, "char_end": 3058}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "6）它最终并不允许人一条道走到黑。", "char_start": 3059, "char_end": 3076}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "它并不是通过给予作弊者额外的恐怖灾难来给予惩罚，而是在完全同样的待遇中给予作弊者单独的痛苦。", "char_start": 3077, "char_end": 3123}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "同样的“物理硬限制”，对于心知肚明是自己的所作所为招致的这最终结果的人和只是被分配到这个问题要面对的人而言，前者感受如在地狱。因为那些逃不过的生活任务不过是所有人都在履行的普普通通的东西。只是因为ta为了维持作弊福利而必须维持无能状态——一旦打破无能就不但要失去福利还要受到偿付责任的追索——所以这些普普通通的生活任务变成了不可逾越的地狱般的困难。", "char_start": 3124, "char_end": 3298}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "每多利用这漏洞一天，地狱就会越收紧一分。一路向下，直到敬酒不吃吃罚酒，或者干脆无声的、没有任何人同情的自然毁灭。", "char_start": 3299, "char_end": 3355}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "而对后者的感受则不过是打工人普普通通的一天，上网吐吐槽，刷一下帖子就顶过去了。至少不会没有基本收入，不会纯要靠别人吃饭、看人脸色。", "char_start": 3356, "char_end": 3421}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "记住，在最终意义上，不是人类不允许人对爱作弊，是这个世界不允许。", "char_start": 3423, "char_end": 3455}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "而这个不允许是写在自然规律里的，不以任何人的意志为转移。", "char_start": 3456, "char_end": 3484}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "幸亏如此。", "char_start": 3485, "char_end": 3490}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 62}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0120"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么有人会想要过一种连自己都嫌弃自己的生活？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061"], "summary": "作者围绕“脱困”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“首先有一点要搞清楚——所有没有被人身禁锢的人，都在过自己想过的生活，哪怕ta在说“我不想过这样的生活”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "首先有一点要搞清楚——所有没有被人身禁锢的人，都在过自己想过的生活，哪怕ta在说“我不想过这样的生活”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 52, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e022937c-f3bb-52bb-b1d4-1d3a758ee49d", "source_ordinal": 3323, "reading_ordinal": 729, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "救人", "published_at": "2021-05-14T16:58:20+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/458209073/answer/1886031929"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这样去凭着隔着网络的只言片语去判断谁是谁非、并且径直去干预人的命运轨迹，其实是很武断的，而且这样干预的方式也隐患很多——比如打电话假装警察这个显然就过了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "他可能很快遇到一个现实问题——一个长期和他聊，或者是短短的聊了一下的少年还是出意外了，那时候就很不好面对人家的家人了。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "又比如ta假装警察给另一个小孩打电话，把另一个小孩吓出意外，那又怎么办呢？", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "他多半是出于安抚自己的悲痛和愧疚，因此产生了一个复杂的动机——比如是出于赎罪。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但这个动机只应该用作正确做事的动力，不能用作豁免错误做事的特殊免罪卡——这不是谁对谁特别无情，而是客观上这个辩解就是无效的，甚至本身也说不通。回头因他失手而受到伤害的孩子的父母们很难接受这样的辩解——你内疚是你的事，为啥拿我儿子练手？我儿子不是你玩赎罪游戏的洋娃娃。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以还是要回到原点——你因为各种机缘巧合有了这样的初心，这很好，但是要认识到这只意味着你要更加严谨、慎重的对待这一份事业。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要更加小心自己可能自我授予无视一切限制的特权——“我在干正义的事业，我免疫于一切罪责”。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "恰恰相反，如果你确实是做正义的事业，你要加倍的在意一切正义的红线——尤其是法律的红线和所有在场和不在场的人的意愿的红线。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "是你的追求的方式保证了你的追求是正义的，而不是你的追求的内容保证了你的追求是正义的。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "否则，你只不过换了一种“为你好”的路数而已，你又比你所打算阻止的喊着“为你好”而窒息自己的孩子的家长们到底强在哪里呢？", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 620}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "对方好歹还是亲生的、合法的法定监护人。这甚至搞不好实际上会变成一种恶化。", "char_start": 621, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "忏悔是非常困难的，并非一个人觉得愧疚，觉得自己在“反其道而行之”，就已经算完事了。你忏悔自己在白墙上涂鸦“在此处撒尿的都是狗”，仅仅换成在墙上工整的写下“在此处撒尿的都不是狗”并无意义。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因为真正成问题的并不是你写了什么——那只是你依道而行的内容，而是你未经允许拿毛笔在白墙上写字——这才是你要反的那个道。", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 811}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "警惕到“不要拿毛笔在墙上写”就够了吗？", "char_start": 812, "char_end": 831}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不，还有那个让你觉得“拿毛笔在墙上写没什么问题”的念头，那是道上之道。", "char_start": 832, "char_end": 867}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "还有那个让你不但不听取对这个念头的反对意见，反而要傲慢、狂暴的杀伤规劝你的人的习惯，那是道上之道之道上之道。", "char_start": 868, "char_end": 922}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实，层层叠叠，归根到底，人类注定将只能忏悔到某一步，在某一步处止步，换汤不换药。", "char_start": 923, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但是，两点：", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 971}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "1）自己清楚明白，而不是自欺欺人“我已经彻底悔改”，会对你有很大好处，这是一个人是不是真正的谦卑的实质根基——而不是什么“哎呀，哪里哪里，我没你说的那么好，你太客气了。”这种口头做派。", "char_start": 972, "char_end": 1064}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "2）即使你忏悔不到最深一层，也不是你在任何一层满足于换汤不换药的理由。", "char_start": 1065, "char_end": 1100}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为你忏悔到了那一层，你就会在社会的阶梯上自动上升到对应的一层，被赋予那一层会被赋予的重任、被人移那样的程度托付生命和希望。你的考试难度会很快的提高到不允许那一层的换汤不换药。事实上，这是这个世界唯一真正的上升正道——你有多深的忏悔，你就有多谦卑，就会被人寄予多大的托付，就会有多大的前途。", "char_start": 1101, "char_end": 1246}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "对你来说，永远是忏悔得越深越好。", "char_start": 1247, "char_end": 1263}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "天将降大任于斯人也，必先苦其心志、劳其筋骨、饿其体肤、空乏其身，行拂乱其所为，所以动心忍性，增益其所不能。", "char_start": 1264, "char_end": 1317}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这是一个残忍的过程，这些话也都是残忍的话，但你不接受这个“残忍”，你将无法造成真正的改变。", "char_start": 1318, "char_end": 1363}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "希望你平安度过。", "char_start": 1364, "char_end": 1372}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0120"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：45 岁中年男人潜入「平均年龄十四五岁的QQ群」，开导寻死青少年，你怎么看这种行为？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "作者围绕“救人”展开正文论述；此为原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核深化。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出或陈述：“这样去凭着隔着网络的只言片语去判断谁是谁非、并且径直去干预人的命运轨迹，其实是很武断的，而且这样干预的方式也隐患很多——比如打电话假装警察这个显然就过了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文论述。", "其余推理步骤待逐段独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["正文论证、事实依据与概念边界需独立复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这样去凭着隔着网络的只言片语去判断谁是谁非、并且径直去干预人的命运轨迹，其实是很武断的，而且这样干预的方式也隐患很多——比如打电话假装警察这个显然就过了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动的最低限度初读记录；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
